# Mini-corpus PDFs are copyrighted (Cell, Nature, Science, BMC, Nat Methods,
# Nat Biotech) and stay out of git. The extraction script and the derived
# vocabulary JSONs under articles/ are tracked. The recursive pattern also
# covers articles/heldout/*.pdf (papers retrieved via UniCA institutional
# access for held-out benchmark work).
articles/*.pdf
articles/**/*.pdf

# Benchmark scaffolding kept local until the ASB evaluation methodology
# stabilises upstream (eval repo from Louis-Felix, post-architecture
# review). Once the convention is fixed, the relevant pieces will move
# under docs/ or be re-committed in their final form.
BENCHMARK_PLAN.md
CORPUS.md
benchmark/

# Draft GitHub issues composed locally before posting. The repo is not
# meant to ship discussion artefacts; once an issue is posted on
# github.com, the local draft is deleted (or stays gitignored).
GITHUB_ISSUE_*.md
